== Effects ==
* Grants one {{e|Bone Heart}} container upon entering a new floor.
** If Isaac has 12 heart containers, the added bone heart will replace the rightmost {{e|Soul Heart}} (if any).

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Brittle Bones}}: Allows Isaac to sacrifice a bone heart for a fire rate increase every floor.
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}}: Adds 2 bone heart containers instead of one.

